Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:03:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第12集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:07.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:01.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科罗拉多州 蒙纽门特）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:11.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（南茜·菲茨杰拉德 秘书）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:08.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（通缉 迪恩·温彻斯特 萨姆·温彻斯特）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:15.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蒙纽门特警局车辆扣押场）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:55.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马文·多德 治安官）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope to hell you boys are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为战争刚打响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the war's just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是维克多·亨里克森特别探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Special Agent Victor Henriksen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作是抓你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job to bring you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着更好 但不非得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive's a bonus, but not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他宣读指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read him the charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,持械抢劫 绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed robbery, kidnapping, and,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,三起一级谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}three counts of first-degree murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你在这世上最不想招惹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the last person on planet Earth you wanna screw with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是露比吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is Ruby, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,未曾有幸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had the pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你是因为我想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I wanna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个恶魔 萨姆 就这么简单 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a demon, Sam. Period. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要我们死 我们想要他们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us dead, we want them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比 她曾是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby, here, was a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你那时还是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course that was when you were human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}are Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Boy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆本该成为大统领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam was supposed to be the Grand Pooh Bah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领军队 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}lead the big army. But.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并没有承担这个责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}he hasn't exactly stepped up to the plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,崛起了新领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new leader rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不怎么喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't like you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢有竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't want the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在外面还有几百个恶魔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a couple hundred more demons out there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界的猎人加起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't enough hunters in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不足以应付这种局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}to handle something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉偷了柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela stole the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信她又胜了我们一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe she got another one over on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚上怎么睡得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you sleep at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,裸着身在钱里打滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rolling naked in money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去找到那贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go hunt the bitch down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定这是贝拉的房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure this is Bela's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经在两州之外了 - 哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two states away by now. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们平常总会玩笑着拌嘴 我想念那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's our usual quippy banter? I miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿回它 贝拉 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it back, Bela. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把小手枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little pistol, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I can't at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.85,0:01:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你这么做会害死多少人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand how many people are gonna die if you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟以为我打算拿它做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is it that you think I plan to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走我们对付恶魔大军的唯一武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the only weapon we have against an army of demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖给出价最高者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sell it to the highest bidder?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know nothing about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我要阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm gonna stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,找都找不到我的人还撂狠话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough words for a guy who can't even find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到你的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find you sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.57,0:02:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为对我来说 没什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have absolutely nothing better to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.29,0:02:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,比找到你更要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to track you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你就错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上就要忙起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to be quite occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我不会采取措施防范你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think I wouldn't take precautions?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move. - Down on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特 你们有权保持沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester, you have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可以 也将被用作呈堂证供\N{\fnArial\fs30}can and will be used against you in a court of law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有权找律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to speak to an attorney…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在审讯期间有律师陪伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have an attorney present during any questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们请不起律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you cannot afford a lawyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府会为你们指派一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}one will be appointed for you at government expense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久没见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓到他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did you get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都哪去了 我叫你把人都叫来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's everyone? I asked for all your men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.43,0:03:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你派去了 跟你一起去抓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got them. They went with you on the raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four men. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一小时内能叫到的所有人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone I could drum up with an hour's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是个小镇 亨里克森探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a small town, Agent Henriksen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉酒闹事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drunk and disorderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚走运了 先生 你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is your lucky night, sir. You are free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨里克森探员 你不能随意放了我的犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Henriksen, you can't just release my prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨里克森探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Henriksen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小镇一向风平浪静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Mayberry P.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:03:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:03:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能选 我也不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this isn't how I would do it if I had my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但线索就是线索 我们必须快速行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a tip's a tip and we had to move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员 我也不是菜鸟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, agent. This ain't my first rodeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从未见识过这样的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never been to a rodeo like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们要带来的是什么人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea who we're about to bring in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 两个逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a couple of fugitives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是你见过的最危险的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most dangerous criminals you've ever laid your eyeballs on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是汉尼拔·莱克特和他的蠢弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think Hannibal Lecter and his half-wit little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们做什么找刺激吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what these guys do for kicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.37,0:04:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖坟 损坏尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dig up graves and mutilate corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不仅仅是杀人犯 治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not just killers, sheriff,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是撒旦崇拜的疯子杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're Satan-worshipping nut-bag killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 配合我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So work with me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽快带他们离开 送去重刑监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get them out of your hair and on their way to Supermax…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:30.17,Title,0,0,0,0,,你赶回家时 还来得及看《农业报告》\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll be home in enough time to watch the Farm Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定全力配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}However we can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排在各个出口处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Post them at the exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.31,0:04:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里德 - 嗯 维克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reidy. - Yeah, Vic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,带进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能准备得更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we're as ready as we're gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. On our way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么都拉个脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why all the sourpusses?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们去牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you to the cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,下手轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the merchandise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.35,0:05:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是你该怕的人 南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not the ones you should be scared of, Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.91,0:05:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次要怎么逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna Houdini out of this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 史蒂文在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. Is Steven in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫他从会议室里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get him out of the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格罗夫斯 - 我抓到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Groves. - I got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为你的墓碑上会写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was betting on your headstone reading,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「抓不到温家兄弟」呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Couldn't catch the Winchester boys."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们明早就会在重刑监狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they'll be at Supermax by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,重兵把守的装甲车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armored bus loaded with men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,装甲车 你想再让我气出溃疡来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bus. What, are you trying to give me an ulcer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们会采取一切防范\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're taking every precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像上次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有上上次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the time before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的 我要派直升机去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw that, I'm sending a chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you think is best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right, and I'll be on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让你再把他们丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take you losing those boys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这几个月来一直是我的头等麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have been a primary thorn in my ass for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维克多 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, Victor? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到之前 眼睛不要离开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glue your eyeballs to them till I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有架直升机要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a chopper on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们没有停机坪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But we don't have a helicopter pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把停车场清空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then clear the damn parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我在琢磨什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm trying to decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, what,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,壮阳药能否改善你的小问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether Cialis will help you with your little condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚吃什么晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}What to have for dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛排还是龙虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steak or lobster?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了 海陆大餐好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell. Surf and turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很值得庆祝的事 毕竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a lot to celebrate. I mean, after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你俩戴着镣铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing you two in chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个重口的混蛋 我们可不是那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kinky son of a bitch. We don't swing that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是先别急着庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I wouldn't bust out the melted butter just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在银行没抓到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't catch us at the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在监狱里没看住我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't keep us in that jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. Screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我低估了你们 我没想到你们那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I underestimated you. I didn't count on you being that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 准备好再弄丢我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Ready to lose us again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了法庭命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready like a court order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在庭审前都把你们扣在内华达州的重刑监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep you in a super-maximum prison in Nevada till trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了把你们隔离在隔音无窗的小牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready like isolation in a soundproof, windowless cell so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,私下里跟你说 那可能违宪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that between you and me, probably unconstitutional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这准备得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that for ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看看萨姆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a good look at Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩再别想相见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two will never see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自鸣得意的笑容呢 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that smug smile, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the wrong guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是打怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 迪恩 其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Dean. Truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们爸爸拿魔鬼论调给你们洗了脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}your daddy brainwashed you with all that devil talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且肯定还摸过你们不该摸的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no doubt touched you in a bad place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 这才是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all. That's reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you shut your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 生活糟心 自备头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But guess what? Life sucks, get a helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为每个人都有伤心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because everybody's got a sob story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是每个人都会变成杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not everybody becomes a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我又少了两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I have two less.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要担心的杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,海陆大餐时间到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's surf-and-turf time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's all this? - What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局没有发明官僚主义 但我们完善了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI didn't invent bureaucracy, we perfected it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我现在把这些都办妥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to do all this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 是的 维克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Now, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去好好看看我们的逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go take a good long gander at our fugitives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史蒂文·格罗夫斯副局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Deputy Director Steven Groves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:09:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴我们中有一个人那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, glad one of us feels that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:09:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己现身等了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you two to come out of the woodwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我得先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I've gotta cut this short.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚会很漫长了 两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a long night, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下枪 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Put the gun down. - Wait. Okay. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.55,0:10:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他打了他 - 我没打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He shot him. - I didn't shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下 - 我没打谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Down. - I didn't shoot anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他打了我 - 马上跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He shot me. - Get on your knees now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.97,0:10:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好 别开枪 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Okay, don't shoot, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.26,0:10:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, here. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没开枪 你去看尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't shoot him. Check the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有血迹 我们没杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no blood. We did not kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Check him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克 没有子弹伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vic, there's no bullet wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能都死几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably been dead for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,交待 不然我开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk or I shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,附身了 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessed. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.83,0:11:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动直升机 我们马上带他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire up the chopper, we're taking them out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 就这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么回事 里德\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that? Reidy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,里德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reidy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,里德 外面怎么回事 里德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reidy? What is going on out there? Reidy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么回事 回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that? Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话啊 里德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Reidy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - My men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亨里克森探员 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agent Henriksen? - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,线路不通 所有电话都断线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get a line. All the phones are out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨里克森 我四个手下呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henriksen! Four of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,网络 我的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Internet, I… My cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,都断线了 这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all dead. How can it all be dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绝不是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.33,0:13:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. It's okay. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.48,0:13:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go. We're gonna go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 - 没人可以离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Nobody's going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的搭档在外面 我的手下也…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your partner is out there. My men are out…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去 也是找死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go out there, we're asking to die too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还不懂吗 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you get it? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在外面 想进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out there and they're coming in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是包围\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a siege.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this might be a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该锁好门窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to lock the doors and the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喘口气 像个理智的\N{\fnArial\fs30}take a breath, and maybe deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,专业人士那样应对这个局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}like train professionals with some sense in their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你撑过去的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you through this, you got my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:13:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别那么怂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't be such a wuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了警局所有人 把你们救出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill everyone in the station and bust you two out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是你们的疯子朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about your psycho friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是他们的血洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about a bloodbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I promise you:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.09,0:14:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管外面是谁 他们不是来帮我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever's out there is not here to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you gotta believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人都身陷险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone here is in terrible danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放我们出去 让我们救你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you let us out of here so we can save your asses?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要说「恶魔」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna say "demons"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.39,0:14:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢说「恶魔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare say "demons."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.81,0:14:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你们 你们该更怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something. You should be a lot more scared of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩膀怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能活着出去的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if we get out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:14:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please, we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是南茜 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Nancy? Nancy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 我哥哥被打中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, my brother's been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在严重流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bleeding really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能给我们找条毛巾来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think maybe you could get us a towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 就一条干净毛巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just one clean towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我们 我们不是坏人 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look at us. We're not the bad guys. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试可嘉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go! Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.49,0:16:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Nance?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再敢耍花招 我就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try something again, get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.79,0:16:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且不会打胳膊了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And not in the arm. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.39,0:16:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里就是活靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're like sitting ducks in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些该死的警察给我们点吃的能死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it kill these cops to bring us a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得外面有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many you figure are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们有多少 他们能附身任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}However many they are, they could be possessing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都能直接走进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone could just walk right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺疯狂的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of wild, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们直冲我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it's like, they're coming right for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是前所未有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never done that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我们被悬赏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we got a contract on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是因为我们太厉害了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's because we're so awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是因为我们太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's because we're so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, howdy there, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了 小子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.86,0:17:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里挺好 但谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just comfy right here, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.99,0:17:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.11,0:17:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要坐在这里等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not just gonna sit around here and wait to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要试试逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,博尔德有个特警队\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a SWAT facility in Boulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们哪都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.60,0:17:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经召唤他们了 他们在赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already called them. They're already coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he…? Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨里克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henriksen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打死了治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没打死副局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't shoot the deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟前 我还好好的 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes ago I was fine and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一股可怕的黑烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some nasty black smoke…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻进了你的喉咙里\N{\fnArial\fs30}jammed itself down your throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,附身 真附身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessed, like possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是附身的感觉 你现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it feels like. Now you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.98,0:19:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真该跟你说个大大的「我早说了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you the biggest I-told-you-so ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米奇警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer Amici.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 但没什么用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's nice. It's not gonna do much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一个军火库呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got an arsenal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能拿BB枪打熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't poke a bear with a BB gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.82,0:20:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只会惹怒它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just gonna make him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots and lots of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,盐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有回声啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there an echo in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,仓库里有除冰盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's road salt in the storeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 在所有窗口和门口撒盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. We need salt at every window and every door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up, Nancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.39,0:20:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从教堂回到家后 会聊起魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would come home from church and talk about the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.77,0:20:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母会叫我别那么当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents would tell me to stop being so literal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我让他们知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I showed them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.99,0:20:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.79,0:21:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在后面的扣押车场 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Impound lot out back. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我得从后备箱里拿点东西来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I gotta get something out of my trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫「还好」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "okay."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 大家都戴上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, everybody needs to put these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.06,0:23:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,能防止你被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll keep you from being possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you and Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.91,0:23:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.54,0:23:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们文多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you had those?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.23,0:24:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是珍娜·鲁布纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Jenna Rubner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.35,0:24:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是珍娜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Jenna anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.35,0:24:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些恶魔黑烟就进入了他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where all that black demon smoke went?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.61,0:24:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.84,0:24:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,装了盐弹的猎枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shotgun shells full of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.43,0:24:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好用就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever works.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.89,0:24:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,用调味料打怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting off monsters with condiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来恶魔是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So turns out demons are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.60,0:24:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 鬼魂也是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}FYI, ghosts are real too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.69,0:25:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有狼人 吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are werewolves, vampires…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.53,0:25:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔童 吃人的邪恶小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}changelings, evil clowns that eat people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.07,0:25:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.62,0:25:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能让你好受点 大脚怪是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you feel better, Bigfoot's a hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.95,0:25:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没好受点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.29,0:25:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.04,0:25:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue. A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.67,0:25:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的工作是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what my job is?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.34,0:25:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了把好人关起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, besides locking up the good guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.35,0:25:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.47,0:25:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作很无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.23,0:25:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很让人挫败\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了一个突破要忙三年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work three years for one break…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你或许能救下几个人 或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then maybe you can save a few people. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.82,0:25:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the payoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.28,0:25:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了抓几个人 忙活了15年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been busting my ass for 15 years to nail a handful of guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.78,0:25:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而与此同时 角落里却有这么可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all this while, there was something off in the corner so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.45,0:25:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.66,0:25:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我定制一个「浪费人生」的杯子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}sign me up for that big frosty mug of wasting my damn life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.75,0:25:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.26,0:26:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.05,0:26:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能打败他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you guys beat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.18,0:26:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能赢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.97,0:26:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我觉得世界会走向血腥的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I think the world's gonna end bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.43,0:26:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不代表我们就该放弃抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean we shouldn't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.94,0:26:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do have choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择英勇就义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose to go down swinging.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.28,0:26:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你也没有家 只有你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, you got nothing to go home to but your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.11,0:26:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.91,0:26:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你有模板般的美好生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, you rocking the white-picket fence?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.66,0:26:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 空荡荡的公寓 一堆愤怒前妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Empty apartment, string of angry ex-wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.71,0:26:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.13,0:26:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.93,0:26:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.18,0:26:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.05,0:26:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是恶魔 - 她是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's a demon. - She's here to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.68,0:26:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.60,0:27:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不放我出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna let me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.99,0:27:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们还说骑士精神已死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they say chivalry's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.41,0:27:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有薄荷糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone have a breath mint?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.79,0:27:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一路杀进来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guts splattered in my mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.08,0:27:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴里溅进了点肠子\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I was killing my way in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.55,0:27:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.80,0:27:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少30个 还只是目前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty at least. That's so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.93,0:27:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 30个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,30个冲我们来的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty hit men all gunning for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.35,0:27:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派他们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.48,0:27:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.57,0:27:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.27,0:27:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了个新红人 很有感召力\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a big new up-and-comer. A real pied piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.36,0:27:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.24,0:27:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not he.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.70,0:27:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.32,0:27:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.33,0:27:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.33,0:27:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的很想把萨姆的内脏插在棍子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she really, really wants Sam's intestines on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.16,0:28:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她大概是把他视为竞争对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess she sees him as competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.96,0:28:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 萨姆 还有什么我该知道的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, jeez, Sam. Is there anything else I should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.55,0:28:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩回头再吵吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the two of you talk about this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.27,0:28:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯尔特枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.77,0:28:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,被偷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.65,0:28:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我肯定是耳朵里进血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I must have blood in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.23,0:28:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我听到你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I just heard you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.11,0:28:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你蠢到让人从你粗笨的手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you were stupid enough to let the Colt get grabbed out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.24,0:28:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢走了柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}your thick, clumsy, idiotic hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.03,0:28:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.87,0:28:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.54,0:28:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露比 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ruby… - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.88,0:28:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我看不出还有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I don't see that there's any other option,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.26,0:28:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有个能救你们活着离开的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's one other way I know how to get you out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.47,0:28:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.76,0:28:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.43,0:28:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,能消灭一英里内\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll vaporize every demon…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.97,0:28:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a one-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.97,0:29:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myself included.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.10,0:29:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你弄丢了柯尔特枪 而我要为此而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you let the Colt out of your sight and now I have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.73,0:29:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次 要更小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So next time, be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.69,0:29:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个遗愿如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that for a dying wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.45,0:29:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们需要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What do we need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.04,0:29:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.54,0:29:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个咒语很特定\N{\fnArial\fs30}This spell is very specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.37,0:29:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要一个有美德的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It calls for a person of virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.83,0:29:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有美德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.05,0:29:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.34,0:29:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是处子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有人是处子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.69,0:29:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.23,0:29:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me. You're…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 这是个选择 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It's a choice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.36,0:29:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你…你从未…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, so you…? You never…?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.07,0:29:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even once?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.57,0:29:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至都没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not even…?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.58,0:30:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.54,0:30:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.83,0:30:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can hold still…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.00,0:30:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把你的心从胸口挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I cut your heart out of your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.63,0:30:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.71,0:30:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提出了一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm offering a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.17,0:30:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're offering to kill somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为等恶魔冲进来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you think's gonna happen to this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.26,0:30:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这姑娘又会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the demons get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.26,0:30:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会保护她的 - 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna protect her. That's what. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.35,0:30:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 你们都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - You're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.22,0:30:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是唯一的办法 - 嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is the only way. - Yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.85,0:30:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们绝不可能 - 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- there's no way… - Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.64,0:30:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让你… - 大家能不能闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that you're gonna prove… - Will everybody please shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.31,0:30:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the people out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.61,0:30:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能救他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will it save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.02,0:30:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把他们体内的恶魔炸飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll blow the demons out of their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.69,0:30:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果他们的身体还完好 那就没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if their bodies are okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我做 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll do it. - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.79,0:30:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝对不行 - 你不用这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell, no. - You don't need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.33,0:30:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友都在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my friends are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.62,0:30:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会牺牲任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't sacrifice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.21,0:30:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那么做 也不比他们强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do that, we're no better than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.96,0:30:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.34,0:30:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的选择不叫选择 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Well, your choice is not a choice. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.05,0:31:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.10,0:31:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.02,0:31:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么了 萨姆 说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on? Sam, tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.27,0:31:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.44,0:31:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说得好 小妹子 - 住口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn straight, cherry pie. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.32,0:31:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,住口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.45,0:31:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人要杀处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody kill any virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.99,0:31:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我需要跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我你不是在考虑这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you're not actually considering this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.00,0:31:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,摁住一个女孩 挖出她的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking about holding down a gril and cutting out her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.84,0:31:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面还有30个人呢 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're also talking about 30 people out there, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.55,0:31:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent people…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.80,0:31:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都会死 这里的每个人也都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are all gonna die, along with everyone in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.38,0:31:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们也不能放弃一切规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't mean that we throw away the rule book.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.76,0:31:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再做人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stop acting like humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.76,0:31:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let that demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.06,0:31:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀一个善良可爱无辜的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill some nice, sweet, innocent girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.73,0:31:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,连床都没上过的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}who hasn't even been laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.23,0:31:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要这样赢得战争 那我不想赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, if that's how you win wars, then I don't wanna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.23,0:31:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.48,0:31:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.82,0:32:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.11,0:32:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不是好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying it's a good one,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.32,0:32:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至未必能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even saying that it'll work…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.66,0:32:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对好过杀个处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it sure as hell beats killing a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.95,0:32:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.62,0:32:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开大门 放他们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the doors. Let them all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.09,0:32:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 设备好用吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get the equipment to work? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.68,0:32:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.31,0:32:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话说得太轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win understatement of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.72,0:32:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.47,0:32:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得… - 不是觉得 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think… - I don't think. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.35,0:32:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.52,0:32:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 小子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.57,0:32:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just gonna leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.69,0:32:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都准备自杀来帮你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna kill myself to help you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.78,0:32:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要站在这里 看你们输\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna stand here and watch you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.79,0:32:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.50,0:32:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.83,0:32:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但显然 我赌错了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But clearly, I bet on the wrong horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.67,0:33:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以放我出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind letting me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.90,0:33:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.65,0:33:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要阻止我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.97,0:33:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All set?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.18,0:33:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.18,0:33:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.43,0:33:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.11,0:34:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I hope this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.92,0:35:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这事结束 我要敞开了做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is over, I'm gonna have so much sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.36,0:35:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是跟你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.28,0:35:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better move.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.48,0:36:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨里克森 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henriksen, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.47,0:38:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得上报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better call it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.89,0:38:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个精彩的我不能讲的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a story I won't be telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.76,0:38:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算怎么跟他们讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.60,0:38:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在接下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The least ridiculous lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.68,0:38:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,五小时里想出最不荒唐的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can come up with in the next five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.77,0:38:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.14,0:38:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是想给你压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to pressure you or anything but,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.60,0:38:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你打算怎么处置我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}what're you planning to do about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.23,0:38:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.90,0:38:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.19,0:38:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在直升机起火时也在机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}were in the chopper when it caught on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.45,0:38:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧得什么都不剩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.61,0:39:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至无法靠牙科记录确认他们的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't even identify them with dental records.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.78,0:39:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,安息吧 两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest in peace, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.84,0:39:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.84,0:39:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.40,0:39:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.45,0:39:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我在找两个男人 一对兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, I'm looking for two boys. They're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.32,0:39:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个很高 一个很帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}One's really tall and one's really cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.83,0:39:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.91,0:39:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.02,0:40:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.45,0:40:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,社区仍因几小时前发生的惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The community is still reeling from the tragedy…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.53,0:40:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而悲痛不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}that happened just a few hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.78,0:40:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当局认为是煤气总管破裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities believe a gas main ruptured,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致了巨大的爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}causing the massive explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.75,0:40:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,将警局炸毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}that ripped apart the police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.66,0:40:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,并夺走了里面所有人的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and claimed the lives of everyone inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.58,0:40:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者包括至少六名警官和员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among the deceased, at least six police officers and staff,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.67,0:40:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括 马文·多德治安官 菲尔·阿米奇警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}including Sheriff Melvin Dodd, Deputy Phil Amici,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘书南茜·菲茨杰拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}secretary Nancy Fitzgerald,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.88,0:40:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有三名联调局探员 史蒂文·格罗夫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as three FBI agents identified as Steven Groves,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.22,0:40:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文·里德和维克多·亨里克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin Reidy and Victor Henriksen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.68,0:40:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两名在押逃犯也丧命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two fugitives in custody were also killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.35,0:40:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将继续在现场跟进报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll continue to follow the story here at the scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.14,0:40:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 回到你那里 吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}but for now, back to you, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.49,0:41:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是我们刚走就发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've happened right after we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.11,0:41:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到爆炸的强度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering the size of the blast…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.33,0:41:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说是莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}smart money's on Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.12,0:41:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in these?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.70,0:41:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,能保护你们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.33,0:41:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让莉莉丝找不到你们 至少暂时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw Lilith off your trail. For the time being, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.63,0:41:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 别谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.09,0:41:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝杀了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith killed everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.92,0:41:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她屠杀了你的宝贝处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}She slaughtered your precious little virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.97,0:41:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有半打其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus a half a dozen other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.14,0:41:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你讲了一大顿战争中的人道主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}So after your big speech about humanity and war,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.26,0:41:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划却是害死了人的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}turns out your plan was the one with the body count.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.52,0:41:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道怎么打仗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to fight a battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.65,0:41:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,先下手为强 绝不留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You strike fast and you don't leave any survivors,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.82,0:41:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免有人跑去向上司打报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}so no one can go running to tell the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.40,0:41:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次 我们按我的计划来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So next time, we go with my plan.
